      <h2 style="text-align:center;">What Our Gas Safe Engineers Check During a Liverpool Boiler Service</h2>
      <p class="pf-sub" style="text-align:center;">A high quality 10-point HHIC check covering every safety and performance point. Done in 45 minutes to 1 hour on most combi boilers.</p>

      <div class="pf-who-grid" style="margin-top:2rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1rem;">
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Flue gas analysis</strong><p>Combustion gases tested to confirm safe burning. Bad readings point to incomplete combustion and possible carbon monoxide risk.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Gas pressure and flow rate</strong><p>Gas supply pressure and flow rate tested. Low pressure causes lockouts and poor performance.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Burner and heat exchanger</strong><p>Burner taken out and checked for debris and damage. Heat exchanger checked for rust, cracks or sludge that would cut efficiency.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Flue integrity and seals</strong><p>Flue checked along its full route. Confirmed intact, sealed and safely venting combustion gases. A leaking flue seal is a CO risk.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Safety devices tested</strong><p>Pressure relief valve, overheat thermostat and gas valve all tested. Each one confirmed to shut the boiler down safely if a fault hits.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>System pressure checked</strong><p>System pressure tested and topped up if needed. Low pressure is a common lockout cause and cuts heating efficiency across the whole central heating system.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Inhibitor level tested and topped up</strong><p>Inhibitor concentration tested. Low inhibitor speeds up rust and sludge. Topped up to the right level as standard on every service.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Controls and programmer</strong><p>Thermostat, programmer and any zone valves checked. A faulty zone valve causes uneven heating even with a fully working boiler.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Magnetic filter cleaned</strong><p>If a magnetic filter is fitted, we clean it as part of the service. A blocked filter cuts flow and strains the pump.</p></div></div>
        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes" style="background:#f1f5f9;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:3px solid #16a34a;border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;display:flex;gap:0.75rem;"><span class="pf-who-icon" style="color:#16a34a;font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1.1rem;">✓</span><div><strong>Full function test and Benchmark updated</strong><p>Full heating and hot water cycle run. Benchmark record updated with service date and findings. Certificate emailed same day.</p></div></div>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-left:4px solid #f97316;border-radius:10px;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;">
        <p style="color:#1a3a5c;font-size:0.88rem;margin:0;font-weight:600;">Find anything? We explain it clearly. We give you a written boiler repair quote before extra work starts. You are never charged for work you haven't said yes to.</p>
